=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Marjoirelle} (H-12) near **Home Point #2** in {z:Western Adoulin} for a cutscene.
* Head to {z:Leafallia} and examine the **Odyssean Passage** for a cutscene.
* Touch the nearby **Test of Talents** for another cutscene.
* Touch the **Test of Talents** again to enter a solo BCNM against the {m:Shadow Lord}.
** You must disband from party or have no other members in the same zone.
** You **may** use buffs that carry over on zone like haste for this fight.
** Trusts **may not** be used in this fight.
** The {m:Shadow Lord} can switch between dual-wield and two-handed sword modes, similar to the Shadowreign version.
*** Gains access to __Blighting Blitz__ while dual-wielding and can potentially one-shot all NPCs except Valli and players without defense gear.
*** Dispels buffs throughout the fight.
**** Appears to be a conal AoE that can absorbed with 4 shadows.
*** Can use {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:Mighty Strikes} and/or {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:Blood Weapon} multiple times throughout the fight.
** You will be assisted by {p:Volker} (WAR), {n:Zeid} (DRK), {n:Valli|Valaineral R Davilles} (PLD), {n:Oshasha|Lutete} (WHM), and {p:Romaa Mihgo} (THF).
*** Oshasha will occasionally use an AoE healing ability if the NPC group takes damage on multiple members.
*** The other NPCs can also use single-target potions and their job's special abilities.
*** **{c=red:Note: }** Losing all five NPCs will result in an automatic loss.
* You will enter a cutscene after the fight.
* Speak with {n:Andreine} in the {z:Celennia Memorial Library} for the final cutscene and your reward.

